# Auto-REQUESTS a review from the maintainer whenever these paths change. It does not
# block a merge: that would need "Require review from Code Owners" in the main branch
# protection, which is intentionally OFF: the auto-approve/auto-merge workflows approve
# Dependabot PRs as github-actions[bot], and a bot cannot satisfy a Code Owners review, so
# turning it on would stall every Dependabot PR that touched these paths. (Today Dependabot
# is lockfile-only npm and touches none of them; the toggle stays off so that cannot change
# silently.)
/.github/                 @mplaws
/.projenrc.ts             @mplaws
/eks-multi-region/docs/iam/  @mplaws
